{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAW is a <strong>narrative driven adventure</strong> about a <strong>queer detective</strong> who is struggling with his identity in a repressive society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/ee4ed04029327727d8f3b8d97f6331c8.poster.avif?t=1761861200\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/ee4ed04029327727d8f3b8d97f6331c8.webm?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/ee4ed04029327727d8f3b8d97f6331c8.mp4?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace your inner animal!</strong> Sniff for clues, lick everything and everyone to gain information.\u00a0Fight your instincts or accept your true self and proudly face the hostile world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/5d701a52369c5c8941d0c5c45d640aa1.poster.avif?t=1761861200\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/5d701a52369c5c8941d0c5c45d640aa1.webm?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/5d701a52369c5c8941d0c5c45d640aa1.mp4?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate crimes.</strong> Keep your identity hidden, there would be consequences if the state would find out... or worse, if your mother would.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/bf48258692e4322046a0b9ba1163d74f.poster.avif?t=1761861200\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/bf48258692e4322046a0b9ba1163d74f.webm?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/bf48258692e4322046a0b9ba1163d74f.mp4?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form lasting relationships.</strong> Talk with other animals. Observe them. Interrogate them. Flirt with them.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the decisions you make are remembered by other characters. Different story lines and interactions will unlock based on your actions, appearances and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/c8e3c1fc93f8865f2d2ff316e753bb4e.poster.avif?t=1761861200\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/c8e3c1fc93f8865f2d2ff316e753bb4e.webm?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/c8e3c1fc93f8865f2d2ff316e753bb4e.mp4?t=1761861200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of MAW is loosely based on personal experiences. Characters and events are fictional. Emotions and everyday struggles depicted in this game are real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/d4fa9c0ba70680f29270e6645ad9f2c5.avif?t=1761861200\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic narrative - Characters react to your decisions, personality, appearance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal instincts - Use animal abilities (sniff, lick, listen, observe) to find clues, explore the environment and interact with other characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable appearance - Wear different outfits and see how the world reacts to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple characters to build a relationship with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible cards with unique furry art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal queer story based on real world experiences</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273860?t=1761861200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273860?t=1761861200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/a0b8fef9c098dccc219c2a1f729d39d39f86a956/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761861200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/a0b8fef9c098dccc219c2a1f729d39d39f86a956/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761861200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"MAW deals with adult queer themes. Some dialogues contain references to sexual acts. Optional collectible magazines feature some drawings of adult characters in suggestive posses. Violence is always only suggested and/or pixelated (censored)."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAW is a <strong>narrative driven adventure</strong> ab